<h3 id="3d-plots">3d plots</h3>
<p>Finally the last type of graphing currently supported is 3d graphs of
data in a table.  This will probably require some more knowledge of
gnuplot to make full use of the many options available.</p>
<p><img src="../images/org-plot/example-7.png" alt="example-7.png"></p>
